00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.000
This is 99% Invisible. Hey, I can't find that under radio. I'm Roman Mars. Uh-uh. You'll turn to that station. I went to graduate school in Athens, Georgia, which is a great place to be from the ages of about 18 to 25. If you like going out to bars and listening to live music.
