And you tossed the long box. There was no reason to keep it around. So REM have a record coming out in 1991. And they're saying to me and to Warner Brothers, there's no way our record is coming out in a long box. We're sensitive to the environment. This is a ridiculous thing. Forget it. And the Warner Brothers sales department is saying it absolutely has to come out in a long box or record retailers are going to penalize you. And that's when Jeff Gold got this idea. He could merge the two projects he was working on.
然后你把长盒扔掉。根本没有理由把它留着。所以 REM 有一张唱片要在 1991 年发行。他们对我和华纳兄弟说，我们的唱片绝不能用长盒装发行。我们对环保很敏感。这是一件荒谬的事情。算了吧。而华纳兄弟的销售部门则表示，它绝对必须用长盒发行，否则唱片零售商会惩罚你们。就在那时，杰夫·戈尔有了这个主意。他可以把他正在进行的两个项目合二为一。

