00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:59.000
take care of rm by turning their long box into a positive if we put a petition on the back of the long box that would go to rock the vote saying i support the motor voter bill and we could distribute it to their respective senators. And I knew we could generate an unbelievable amount of mail doing that. Jeff Gold got on the phone with Jeff Aeroff and they agreed that this would be the strategy. They would turn the album long box into a piece of political machinery and they would
通过在长盒背面印上一份致“摇滚选民”的请愿书，表达“我支持机动选民法案”，并将其分发给各自的参议员，以此把 REM 的长盒变成一件积极的事情。我知道这样做能产生数量惊人的信件。杰夫·戈尔给杰夫·艾罗夫打了电话，双方一致认为这将是接下来的战略。他们要把专辑长盒变成一台政治机器，并向国会

