00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:29.000
flood Congress with support for the motor voter bill. That Monday, Jeff called R.E.M.'s manager with the plan. And he said, all right, let me call the guys and I'll call you back. I probably heard back from them within an hour and he said, great idea. They're totally into it. Let's do it. So out of time, hit the record stores on March 12, 1991. And then the petition started rolling in. And I remember vividly, maybe four or five days after the record had come out. I mean, a very short period of time. And they had bags full of these things.
如潮水般涌入对“机动选民法案”的支持。那个周一，杰夫带着这个计划给 REM 的经理打了电话。他说，好吧，我给小伙子们打个电话再回给你。我大概在一小时内就收到了他的回复，他说，好主意。他们完全赞同。就这么办。于是《Out of Time》于 1991 年 3 月 12 日登陆唱片店。随后请愿书开始雪片般飞来。我清晰地记得，大约在唱片发行四五天后。我是说，在非常短的时间内。他们就收到了装满这些东西的麻袋。

