It was really incredible. Nobody can seem to put their hand on what the exact number of that we got of these were. But I remember thinking, wow, after three weeks we've got 10,000. I mean, that's, you know, 100 percent of the, that's already half of what Richard Cloudward said would make an impact. And these things just kept coming in and drove. There were canvas bags full of them coming in. About a month after Arem released the album, Rock the Votes political director plus two
这真的很不可思议。似乎没人能说清我们具体收到了多少封这类的信。但我记得当时想，哇，三周后我们已经收到了 10,000 封。我的意思是，你知道的，这已经是理查德·克劳德所说会产生影响的数量的一半了。而且这些东西还在源源不断地涌来。装满它们的帆布袋正不断运进来。在 REM 发行这张专辑大约一个月后，“摇滚选民”的政治总监加上

